  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Some avatars that are set up as humanoid but not meant to be used in fullbody will never calibrate right as they are not intended for full body. avatars that are things like animals or monsters may not need fullbody but the extra trackers cause the body to distort. it would be nice to have a button that either calibrates with as if  you didn't have the extra trackers on or a toggle if. A toggle could be useful if trackers die and the player wants to continue with out restarting Vrchat",
